WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.950
Every class has its own language.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.830
You learn a word in lecture.

3
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.010
And by Friday, it's gone.

4
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:09.700
Margin keeps it for you.

5
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.347
Select a word, then press Option Shift S,

6
00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:15.080
or just click Save term.

7
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.090
Then pick a definition that fits your class.

8
00:00:19.681 --> 00:00:22.168
Now it's underlined wherever you study.

9
00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:24.648
On Canvas, in your textbook,

10
00:00:24.668 --> 00:00:26.271
in your lecture slides.

11
00:00:26.781 --> 00:00:30.011
Hover, and your definition is right there.

12
00:00:31.481 --> 00:00:32.921
Open a lecture PDF,

13
00:00:32.941 --> 00:00:35.431
and Margin finds the key terms for you.

14
00:00:36.181 --> 00:00:38.308
The class sidebar keeps every term for that

15
00:00:38.328 --> 00:00:40.513
class beside you, starting with the ones on

16
00:00:40.533 --> 00:00:41.651
this page.

17
00:00:43.231 --> 00:00:45.111
Before the exam, quiz yourself.

18
00:00:45.131 --> 00:00:47.581
The ones you miss come back first.

19
00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:48.788
It's free.

20
00:00:48.808 --> 00:00:49.625
No account.

21
00:00:49.645 --> 00:00:52.011
Your notes stay on your laptop.

22
00:00:52.731 --> 00:00:53.311
Margin.

23
00:00:53.331 --> 00:00:55.801
Every term, in the margin.
